{"quest_id": 6499, "name": "研究熱心な召喚士", "description": "領内の視察を終えた王子達の前に、\n研究に没頭するファルネが通りかかる。\n彼女から持ち掛けられた相談とは……。\n初級（★１獲得の目安：平均Lv1 出撃5体）", "event": "世界樹の花嫁", "event_category": "History", "mission_id": 920111, "map_no": 5356, "level": 100, "multiplier": 1.0, "charisma": 25, "exp": 150, "gold": 600, "drops": [{"item": 5002, "c": 1}, {"item": 1001, "c": 1}], "capacity": 8, "enemies": [{"enemy_id": 1, "source": "local", "count": 5, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 900, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 900, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 50, "attack_speed": 60, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 153, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097360, "race_id": 9, "master_id": 16, "spawn_sec": 3}, {"enemy_id": 2, "source": "local", "count": 24, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 640, "attack": 140, "base_hp": 640, "base_attack": 140, "damage_type": "physical", "attack_speed": 40, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 101, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.25, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097200, "race_id": 9, "master_id": 3, "spawn_sec": 6}, {"enemy_id": 3, "source": "local", "count": 7, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 640, "attack": 200, "base_hp": 640, "base_attack": 200, "damage_type": "physical", "attack_range": 140, "attack_speed": 70, "attack_wait": 60, "attack_interval": 171, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 1, "dot_rate": 1.2999999523162842, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2098016, "race_id": 9, "missile_id": 9, "missile": {"speed": 3.0, "deflectable": true}, "master_id": 68, "global_id": 67, "ranged": true, "spawn_sec": 68}, {"enemy_id": 4, "source": "local", "count": 1, "form_index": 0, "form_count": 1, "hp": 1350, "attack": 300, "base_hp": 1350, "base_attack": 300, "damage_type": "physical", "armor_defense": 75, "magic_defense": 50, "attack_speed": 60, "attack_wait": 10, "attack_interval": 153, "move_speed": 700.0, "gain_cost": 2, "dot_rate": 1.5, "assassin_resist": 2000, "transform_resist": 2000, "pattern_id": 2097360, "race_id": 9, "special_effect_id": 222, "master_id": 31074, "global_id": 4693, "route_behaviour": {"calls_event": [2011, 2012, 2013, 2014]}, "spawn_sec": 105}], "dialogue": [{"trigger": "start", "lines": [{"name": "アンナ", "text": "……ふふっ。\nさっきの赤ちゃん、とっても可愛かったですね。"}, {"name": "ケイティ", "text": "ええ。新たな命が生まれ、育まれているのを見ると、\n各地が徐々に復興しつつあることを実感させられますね。", "face": "u114"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "本当に、領内視察に来て正解でした。\nそれでは王子、そろそろ帰りま――あら？"}, {"name": "ファルネ", "text": "…………。", "face": "u158"}, {"name": "ソーマ", "text": "あ。あの本読みながら歩いてるのって、\n召喚士のファルネさんですよね？\nおーいっ、ファルネさーん。", "face": "u23"}, {"name": "ファルネ", "text": "――ひゃっ！？\nって……王子。丁度よかった、探してたのよ。", "face": "u158"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "珍しいですね。王子になにか御用ですか？"}, {"name": "ファルネ", "text": "あ、うん。召喚魔法の研究をしてたら\nちょっと気になる文献を見つけちゃってね。", "face": "u158"}, {"name": "ファルネ", "text": "そのことについて\n王子に相談しに行こうと思ってたんだけど……。", "face": "u158"}, {"name": "ゴブリン", "text": "――ギャッギャッ！\nニンゲン、ミツケタ！　タオス！　タオス！", "face": "l75f83af8d8b8"}, {"name": "ケイティ", "text": "……それどころではなさそうですね。\nファルネさん、ここは私たちにお任せください。", "face": "u114"}]}, {"trigger": "end", "lines": [{"name": "ダニエラ", "text": "……ふぅ。とりあえず片付いたかしら。", "face": "u43"}, {"name": "ケイティ", "text": "ええ。皆さん、お疲れ様でした。", "face": "u114"}, {"name": "カリオペ", "text": "それにしても、\nさっきの変な魔物は一体なんだったのかしら？", "face": "u42"}, {"name": "ファルネ", "text": "――ん？　これは……。", "face": "u158"}, {"name": "ソーマ", "text": "わぁ……可愛い花びらですね♪\nファルネさん、それ拾ったんですか？", "face": "u23"}, {"name": "ファルネ", "text": "あ、うん……さっきの魔物が落としていったみたい。", "face": "u158"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "そういえばファルネさんは、\n王子にご相談があっていらしたのですよね？", "face": "lbb3a22565b44"}, {"name": "ファルネ", "text": "……そうだったわね。\n王子、あとで部屋に行ってもいいかしら？", "face": "u158"}, {"name": "王子", "text": "…………（こくり）", "face": "u1"}, {"name": "アンナ", "text": "決まりですね。\nそれでは、魔物も撃退できたことですし、\nひとまず帰還いたしましょう。"}]}, {"trigger": "route", "enemy_ids": [4], "lines": [{"name": "カリオペ", "text": "……ねえ、アイツちょっと様子がおかしくない？", "face": "u42"}, {"name": "ファルネ", "text": "確かに、他の魔物と雰囲気が違うわね。", "face": "u158"}, {"name": "ファルネ", "text": "……というか、この辺りの魔物としては\nあり得ないくらいの魔力と生命力を秘めてるみたい……。", "face": "u158"}, {"name": "ファルネ", "text": "……王子、気をつけて。\nあれだけの魔力を秘めている個体だと魔法の効果も\n薄いでしょうし、同種の魔物よりも手強いと思うわ。", "face": "u158"}]}], "map": {"image": "Map920111_5356", "w": 960, "h": 640, "spots": [{"k": "b", "x": 476, "y": 329}, {"k": "m", "x": 251, "y": 177, "id": 200}, {"k": "m", "x": 403, "y": 118, "id": 201}, {"k": "m", "x": 349, "y": 190, "id": 202}, {"k": "m", "x": 336, "y": 279, "id": 203}, {"k": "m", "x": 313, "y": 349, "id": 204}, {"k": "m", "x": 248, "y": 408, "id": 205}, {"k": "m", "x": 353, "y": 417, "id": 206}, {"k": "m", "x": 448, "y": 417, "id": 207}, {"k": "m", "x": 527, "y": 434, "id": 208}, {"k": "m", "x": 617, "y": 463, "id": 209}, {"k": "m", "x": 670, "y": 388, "id": 210}, {"k": "m", "x": 791, "y": 395, "id": 211}, {"k": "m", "x": 652, "y": 322, "id": 212}, {"k": "m", "x": 648, "y": 242, "id": 213}, {"k": "m", "x": 759, "y": 217, "id": 214}, {"k": "m", "x": 654, "y": 167, "id": 215}, {"k": "m", "x": 555, "y": 176, "id": 216}, {"k": "m", "x": 459, "y": 182, "id": 217}, {"k": "r", "x": 181, "y": 234, "id": 300}, {"k": "r", "x": 265, "y": 245, "id": 301}, {"k": "r", "x": 264, "y": 304, "id": 302}, {"k": "r", "x": 213, "y": 349, "id": 303}, {"k": "r", "x": 430, "y": 240, "id": 304}, {"k": "r", "x": 556, "y": 237, "id": 305}, {"k": "r", "x": 509, "y": 125, "id": 306}, {"k": "r", "x": 755, "y": 139, "id": 307}, {"k": "r", "x": 716, "y": 459, "id": 308}, {"k": "r", "x": 709, "y": 263, "id": 309}, {"k": "r", "x": 780, "y": 281, "id": 310}, {"k": "r", "x": 716, "y": 333, "id": 311}, {"k": "r", "x": 790, "y": 343, "id": 312}]}, "start_cost": 10, "active": true, "name_en": "The Diligent Summoner", "description_en": "As the Princes finish their inspection of the domain, Farne passes by, absorbed in her research.\nShe approaches them with a request... Beginner (★1 target: Avg Lv